{"c":[{"id":"8a57d435513e6ce9","sum":"2026-10-21: operator dropped HNSW (a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Exact top-100 was 130 ms vs 34 ms indexed. DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). COPY FROM DATABASE then made a 506 MB file in 5.2 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T024529Z-428ab7ddc503aa7e","text":"Live-copy measurements 2026-10-21 (DuckDB 2.0.0): DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161,453 to 6,846 (37.4 GiB freed in the file); COPY FROM DATABASE then gave a 506 MB file in 5.2 s. Exact top-100 search: 130 ms median vs 34 ms HNSW.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T041848Z-871fed0b54c48740","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: drop the HNSW index (two-way door; a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Reverses 'HNSW stays'. Exact top-100 over 133,793 vectors is 130 ms on 2.0.0. Needs an L4 milestone re-plan.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a604a7266b9252d1","sum":"2026-10-21: dedup-before-join exact search was 153 ms on 2.0 (1.3 s join-first). A file with HNSW and vss unloaded opened on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, with or without a killed-embed wal, kept every row; DROP INDEX in a transaction, then insert and checkpoint, worked.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T042746Z-f215752aa66f27d4","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, vss never loaded (autoload off): a file with the HNSW index, with or without a .wal from a killed 1.5.4 embed, opens, keeps every row, runs exact array_cosine_distance, DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, checkpoint.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043947Z-1bad7ee0aac20fca","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, live copy (133,793 vectors): exact semantic as join messages then QUALIFY row_number() takes 1.3 s on 2.0.0 (1.7 s on 1.5.4); group-by-min, LIMIT, then join messages takes 153 ms (205 ms). Role scope: 1.15 s vs 363 ms. Dedup before joining text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
